<title>USA: FFO, Republic get regulatory OKs.</title>
<headline>FFO, Republic get regulatory OKs.</headline>
<dateline>ST CLOUD, Fla. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>F.F.O. Financial Group Inc and Republic Bancshares Inc said on Wednesday they received regulatory approvals from the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation, the Florida Department of Banking and the Federal Reserve to proceed with the proposed acquisition by Republic of F.F.O.</p>
<p>The acquisition, which remains subject to approval of the shareholders of both F.F.O. and Republic, is expected to close prior to the end of the third quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
